  "result": "Perfect! All 50 tests pass, including the 13 new tests for addLine and removeLine.\n\n**Added to src/errors.js:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 when removing a SKU that doesn't exist on the invoice\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 when trying to modify an invoice that's not in draft status\n\n**Added to src/invoices.js:**\n- `addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })` \u2014 adds a new line or increases qty if SKU already exists\n  - Validates qty is a positive integer (QTY_INVALID)\n  - Validates SKU exists (UNKNOWN_SKU)\n  - Only works on draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n  - Never mutates input\n\n- `removeLine(invoice, sku)` \u2014 removes a line by SKU\n  - Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU isn't on invoice\n  - Returns NO_LINES if it's the last line\n  - Only works on draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n  - Never mutates input\n\n**Added 13 tests covering:**\n- Adding new lines and increasing quantities\n- All error conditions (UNKNOWN_SKU, QTY_INVALID, NOT_DRAFT, LINE_NOT_FOUND, NO_LINES)\n- Input immutability\n- Chaining multiple operations (add \u2192 remove \u2192 add, etc.)",
